# Environment Variables for BMG Landing Page

# Google Maps API Key
# Get your API key from: https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/embed/get-api-key
# Note: Use PUBLIC_ prefix for client-side variables in Astro
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Google reCAPTCHA Site Key (v2)
# Get your site key from: https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin
# Note: Use PUBLIC_ prefix for client-side variables in Astro
PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your_recaptcha_site_key_here

# Development Note:
# Copy this file to .env and replace the placeholder values with your actual API keys
# The .env file should never be committed to version control for security reasons
# In Astro, environment variables must be prefixed with PUBLIC_ to be accessible in client-side code

# Note: reCAPTCHA Secret Key should only be stored on your server/backend
# Never include secret keys in client-side environment variables